      "content": "i know, i know, but it's getting so much bigger and the pain is making it hard to sleep. i'm pretty good with a needle, im a tattoo artist so i know all about sterilization. if i just use a flame and some alcohol and do a really clean incision, isn't that basically what a doctor does anyway? i just need to get the pressure out so it stops throbbing.",
